   "en": "«MISHNA:» In the case of «one who slits [hatzorem] the ear of a firstborn» offering, «that» person «may never slaughter» that animal. This is «the statement of Rabbi Eliezer. And the Rabbis say:» If «another blemish» later «develops in» the firstborn, «he may slaughter» the animal «on» account of that second blemish."
